<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: anaconda -->
  <AEXP_Anaconda.label>水蟒</AEXP_Anaconda.label>
  <!-- EN: The anaconda is the heaviest and one of the longest known snake species, reaching lengths of 5 meters. They are a primarily nocturnal species that tends to spend most of its life in or around water. -->
  <AEXP_Anaconda.description>水蟒是已知最重、最長的蛇類，能達5米長。夜行性物種，大部分時間生活在水中或水邊。</AEXP_Anaconda.description>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <AEXP_Anaconda.tools.head.label>頭</AEXP_Anaconda.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: indian elephant -->
  <AEXP_IndianElephant.label>印度象</AEXP_IndianElephant.label>
  <!-- EN: The Indian elephant is one of the largest unmodified land animals. In general, Indian elephants are smaller, have smaller ears, but relatively broader skulls and larger trunks than African elephants, and have the highest body point on the head. -->
  <AEXP_IndianElephant.description>印度象是最大的原生陸地動物之一。一般來說，印度象比非洲象體型更小，耳朵更小，頭骨和象牙更大，頭部上的重力支點也更高。</AEXP_IndianElephant.description>
  <!-- EN: left foot -->
  <AEXP_IndianElephant.tools.left_foot.label>左足</AEXP_IndianElephant.tools.left_foot.label>
  <!-- EN: right foot -->
  <AEXP_IndianElephant.tools.right_foot.label>右足</AEXP_IndianElephant.tools.right_foot.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <AEXP_IndianElephant.tools.head.label>頭</AEXP_IndianElephant.tools.head.label>
  
